Description: VeltOS Settings, a Windows 11 style settings app
 Settings laid out like Windows 11: a navigation pane (System, Bluetooth &
 devices, Network & internet, Personalization, Apps, Accounts, Time &
 language, Gaming, Accessibility, Privacy & security, VeltOS Update) with a
 search box, and pages of settings.
 .
 Built in: Home, About (device specifications, rename this PC), Storage,
 Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Sound, Display (several displays, scale, resolution,
 orientation, refresh rate; Windows + P's Project flyout), Background,
 Colours (light/dark mode, accent colour), Date & time and the list of
 installed Windows programs, Notifications, Power & battery, Night light,
 Multitasking, Mouse, Touchpad, Typing (keyboard layouts), Lock screen,
 Default apps, Startup, Your info, Sign-in options (password), Other
 users, Language & region, Accessibility (text size, animations) and file
 search. KDE's settings windows never open: `systemsettings` and
 `kcmshell6` are diverted to a redirect that opens the matching page.
